    description: Some("The player steers Pac-Man around a maze eating wafers while four ghosts give chase, escaping through passages at the top and bottom of the screen. Eating a flashing power pill turns the ghosts blue and edible for a short time. A single orange vitamin stands in for the arcade\'s fruit, and the ghosts each draw only once every four frames, so they flicker heavily."),
